          "original benchmark question graded strictly (open bar), the original question with column differences ignored (hatched), and explicit V "
          "of the benchmark's own reference SQL (solid); 95% intervals.",
          "- **Panel (b), BIRD (n = 162) and Spider (n = 51).** Why the original question failed, from the development questions (two Haiku runs "
