          "### How to read it",
          "- Every solver is near 100% from explicit V (96-100%) and far below it from the original question; 0-2 questions per solver are right "
          "only from the original. Stating the reference's computation exactly removes most of what makes these questions hard.",
          "- Much of the gap is the form of the output: ignoring column differences closes most of Spider's gap but leaves most of BIRD's. "
          "That BIRD's questions are harder to read is our interpretation of the causes (more phrases mapped to another column or value, more "
